## Recommended Next Steps

1. Rename `ExampleRecord` to your first real model when you are ready.
2. Keep the conventional file names so MicroSys discovery can find them automatically.
3. Register the app in the project manually, or use `python -m microsys startapp {{ app_name }} --register`.

## Sections vs Custom Views

- Use `is_section = True` when the model fits the MicroSys sections workflow and can live in the system-managed CRUD screen.
- Keep custom views when the model needs a project-owned page flow, dashboard, or business process.

## Preferred Helpers and Bases

- Use `microsys/form_base.html` for full-page forms.
- Use `microsys/list_base.html` for list/filter pages.
- Use `set_field_attrs()` in custom forms for the standard widget surface.
- Use `setup_filter_helper()` or `advanced_filter_helper()` for MicroSys-friendly filters.
